### Image Service: Upload Listing Image
# Note: You have to attach a binary file in the real world
POST http://localhost:8092/api/listings/{{image_listing_id}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="car_image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_image.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

> {%
client.global.set("uploaded_image_id", response.body.data.id);
%}

### Image Service: Reorder Images
PUT http://localhost:8092/api/listings/{{image_listing_id}}/images/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageIds": [
    "{{uploaded_image_id}}"
  ]
}

### Image Service: Delete Image
DELETE http://localhost:8092/api/listings/{{image_listing_id}}/images/{{uploaded_image_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Image Service: Upload Avatar
POST http://localhost:8092/api/users/me/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test_avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--
